# TypeScript UI

`src/phone` and `src/desktop` stay separate. Shared types live in `src/shared`.

The UI calls Tauri commands. It does not open a socket and it does not write the history directory.

Editor tools are the union `Crop | Arrow | Text | Blur`. Add a tool as a new variant instead of rewriting the canvas.

User-facing strings live in `src/shared/locales/en.ts`. A later locale is a new file, not a hard-coded string in a component.
